Je trosku problem, kdyz hlavni a v podstate jedina postava je uplne permanentne trapna. A neprijemna. Jak se jako mam bavit, kdyz ten clovek je totalne nesympaticky a nevtipny? Navic ty scenky jsou pod hranici demence. (Tu jednu hvezdu davam proto, ze jsem mohl mit smulu na dil a na ten hruzostrasny dabing)(18.07.2017)","stars":1}],"vods":[],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/369537-amyino-plodne-luno/prehled/","csfd_id":369537,"root_id":369537,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":5,"episode_count":44,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":7,"first_vod_date":"2022-10-27","last_vod_date":"2022-11-10","episodes":[{"season_no":5,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2022-10-27","title":"Tanks (S05E03)","platforms":["Paramount+"]},{"season_no":5,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2022-11-03","title":"Awwwww (S05E04)","platforms":["Paramount+"]},{"season_no":5,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":"2022-11-10","title":"Quiet Pills (S05E05)","platforms":["Paramount+"]}]}